  "description": "Storage-tier twins for issue #231 (tier accounting, ISS-235 phase 6). Every family runs the same full-tree case three times, once per resolved memory policy; the seed, tree, ranges, abstraction, iteration budget and memory budget are identical and precision is forced to f32 so the staged compact precision actually stages. Comparisons are derived by storage_tier_report.py.",
